  zone The Barrens
  tip Echeyakee, a white lion, prowls the plains north of the Razormane camp.
  tip Careful: Savannah Huntresses roam around the lair. They respawn quickly and often join the fight alongside Echeyakee, so clear them out before you blow the horn.
  use 10327 @55.8,17.1 map 1413
